BT /F2 14 Tf 44.0 500.0 Td (What this feature does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 476.0 Td (- Recruiter submits a JD and resumes or existing candidate IDs through Flask APIs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 458.0 Td (- Main HR Orchestrator creates a run record and routes the task to the correct workflow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 440.0 Td (- Screening Workflow runs specialized agents in sequence: JD, Resume, Matching, Ranking, Summary.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 422.0 Td (- OpenAI is used through the local llm_extraction helper where extraction or scoring needs LLM support.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 404.0 Td (- LangChain and LangGraph are listed as dependencies, but this code path is a custom Python pipeline.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 44.0 378.0 Td (Key modules) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 355.0 Td (- routes/agentic_routes.py: API layer for /api/agentic/run and /api/agentic/screening.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 337.0 Td (- orchestration/main_orchestrator.py: creates run IDs, stores status, and dispatches task types.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 319.0 Td (- workflows/screening_workflow.py: sequential screening pipeline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 301.0 Td (- agents/*.py: role-specific Python agents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 283.0 Td (- tools/*.py and services/*.py: reusable database, extraction, matching, and persistence logic.) Tj ET
